# live-run scratch (plan 04-10 Task 4)
# The before-state SHA and the new record's id are written to FILES rather than exported,
# because the action and its verify block are separate shell invocations and exported state
# does not survive between them. They are run scratch, not deliverables.
.live-run-before-sha
.live-run-photo-id
